rojectId in app.json", "created_at": "2026-01-31T14:50:07Z", "repo": "GymAPP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a64566ad577443780dd9112057bb6443d8a473be", "message": "Add Android package name", "created_at": "2026-01-31T14:27:12Z", "repo": "GymAPP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e9bc6d1b4cd0a8ee218743aa7e480d62e310837d", "message": "Add EAS configuration", "created_at": "2026-01-31T14:14:20Z", "repo": "GymAPP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c1cbd986b1a6f7968beeb7658f4b3b69f2442e11", "message": "Tornando o projeto para uso real", "created_at": "2026-01-31T14:05:04Z", "repo": "GymAPP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6985d93a8a00339ae4c9469904964da507e88651", "message": "README final\n\nUpdated README to clarify data storage and interface components.", "created_at": "2025-11-06T00:55:05Z", "repo": "GymAPP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "11fe12585b2b683fe7489014221f0a5fedb7346a", "message": "Enhance README with demo and Expo Snack link\n\nAdd demo video link and Expo Snack access to README", "created_at": "2025-11-06T00:33:06Z", "repo": "GymAPP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3cf95101efa246517cf91e204a396a6ca8c4529e", "message": "Change image syntax to HTML in README\n\nUpdated image syntax in README to use HTML tags with specified width.", "created_at": "2025-11-06T00:24:45Z", "repo": "GymAPP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "583de75acd6dae91e26317f1264bc8e2a1f0cd77", "message": "Enhance README with links and image previews\n\nUpdated links and added image previews for app screens.", "created_at": "2025-11-06T00:22:59Z", "repo": "GymAPP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2d7e2786aa551b075e4ef5d6ada4d49859973b09", "message": "Add screenshots for app screens in README", "created_at": "2025-11-06T00:20:35Z", "repo": "GymAPP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2f56ccd4b869f99e026fc467b93ac12a49f25f3f", "message": "Fotos do APP\n\nFotos do funcionamento do APP", "created_at": "2025-11-06T00:18:17Z", "repo": "GymAPP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a8b81e7120c61c6932792d59788eb25a6f49ab18", "message": "Vers\u00e3o Final 2.0\n\nAlguns erros no perfil e cadastro que foram corrigidos", "created_at": "2025-11-06T00:11:17Z", "repo": "GymAPP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "012aa5307354c57e9c59c0230d08b3d0bc0188c3", "message": "README for GymApp\n\nDescri\u00e7\u00e3o do projeto", "created_at": "2025-11-06T00:09:05Z", "repo": "GymAPP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fe69b332cb6a09291ba2fd86d694cca4cdcef0ec", "message": "Vers\u00e3o Final\n\nA vers\u00e3o final do aplicativo implementa a identidade visual a todas as telas, sem altera\u00e7\u00f5es significativas nas l\u00f3gicas das telas. Cada tela contem imagens de fundo e o uso de \u00edcones para auxiliar o funcionamento e deixar ainda mais est\u00e9tico, utilizando da biblioteca Feather e MaterialCommunityIcons.", "created_at": "2025-11-05T21:01:58Z", "repo": "GymAPP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5e4e944dbca5f40afafcc1e283ffdde64c9850bc", "message": "Perfil Implementado\n\nUltimo bloco de estrutura implementado. Este ultimo bloco permite que o usu\u00e1rio tenha acesso as informa\u00e7\u00f5es cadastradas anteriormente, com a op\u00e7\u00e3o de mudar as informa\u00e7\u00f5es, seja email, nome ou senha. Tamb\u00e9m permite o usu\u00e1rio sair da sess\u00e3o.", "created_at": "2025-11-05T02:31:00Z", "repo": "GymAPP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "092c2b9ccee92fc822afa74b9c462436d416ea51", "message": "Alimenta\u00e7\u00e3o Implementada\n\nO bloco alimenta\u00e7\u00e3o possibilita ao usu\u00e1rio criar blocos de refei\u00e7\u00e3o, estipulando qual a refei\u00e7\u00e3o do dia (Caf\u00e9, Almo\u00e7o, ...) e os alimentos que vai consumir. A ideia \u00e9 permitir uma organiza\u00e7\u00e3o melhor e controle da dieta. Utiliza da mesma l\u00f3gica de cria\u00e7\u00e3o de blocos feita nos exerc\u00edcio.", "created_at": "2025-11-05T01:25:51Z", "repo": "GymAPP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3f784e86e2d52d577339e82eb0173640c45fbf5c", "message": "Hidrata\u00e7\u00e3o implementada\n\nA hidrata\u00e7\u00e3o foi implementada ao sistema, contendo duas novas depend\u00eancias, uma para \u00edcones e outra para barra de preenchimento circular {AnimatedCircularProgress}. A pagina possibilita que o usu\u00e1rio controle a ingest\u00e3o de \u00e1gua atrav\u00e9s de uma meta di\u00e1ria, que pode ser modificada de acordo com o usu\u00e1rio e bot\u00f5es referentes a medidas em ml e L, tamb\u00e9m podendo ser modificado pelo usu\u00e1rio. A meta de ingest\u00e3o h\u00eddrica \u00e9 reiniciada de acordo com o dia, a verifica\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 feita atrav\u00e9s de uma fun\u00e7\u00e3o que pega o dia atual e compara com a data do ultimo dia que foi feita uma a\u00e7\u00e3o na tela, se for diferente ele reinicia a contagem. (Essa verifica\u00e7\u00e3o ocorre ao entrar na tela)", "created_at": "2025-11-04T02:25:36Z", "repo": "GymAPP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "42e19c5c2136d23aabf59645fe3b0c59e3002751", "message": "Treino Completo\n\nA se\u00e7\u00e3o de treino est\u00e1 completa! Agora \u00e9 poss\u00edvel criar, editar e excluir treinos. Tamb\u00e9m podemos adicionar exerc\u00edcios ao treino e iniciar o treinamento de acordo com as informa\u00e7\u00f5es cadastradas. O armazenamento continua atrav\u00e9s do Async, j\u00e1 que foi a maneira mais simples para implementa\u00e7\u00e3o e teste. Todas as novas telas seguem na pasta blocos.", "created_at": "2025-11-02T19:30:10Z", "repo": "GymAPP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7f957c45ead492c0cc69f81a441b00a969253700", "message": "Delete Treino completo directory\n\nFoi errado", "created_at": "2025-11-02T19:29:10Z", "repo": "GymAPP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2e2caceba9698316fbf94906e37335fff11b55b2", "message": "Treino Completo\n\nA se\u00e7\u00e3o de treino est\u00e1 completa! Agora \u00e9 poss\u00edvel criar, editar e excluir treinos. Tamb\u00e9m podemos adicionar exerc\u00edcios ao treino e iniciar o treinamento de acordo com as informa\u00e7\u00f5es cadastradas. O armazenamento continua atrav\u00e9s do Async, j\u00e1 que foi a maneira mais simples para implementa\u00e7\u00e3o e teste. Todas as novas telas seguem na pasta blocos.", "created_at": "2025-11-02T19:27:26Z", "repo": "GymAPP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "351b9ccd050d20c9abef243c28ffde5de57255e6", "message": "Tela de Treinos\n\nAtualiza\u00e7\u00f5es das depend\u00eancias", "created_at": "2025-11-02T00:33:57Z", "repo": "GymAPP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9c680def642c69e4b7207ece3f846a43765a8b7a", "message": "Tela de Treinos\n\nNavega\u00e7\u00e3o pelo bot\u00e3o", "created_at": "2025-11-02T00:32:47Z", "repo": "GymAPP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8327c8a832339a39a4957d670768dd68c81ef3d5", "message": "Tela de Treinos\n\nColocando a tela na estrutura Tab", "created_at": "2025-11-02T00:31:36Z", "repo": "GymAPP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "30f9b90ac5ec46e4a8bd05a8e946f2144e254229", "message": "Tela de Treinos\n\nInclui a tela de treinos parcialmente funcionando, ainda n\u00e3o tem conex\u00e3o com o firebase, por\u00e9m j\u00e1 \u00e9 poss\u00edvel criar uma instancia de treino editar o nome e excluir.", "created_at": "2025-11-02T00:29:19Z", "repo": "GymAPP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ff217e47b989d416e487a64b32466c2f5e2e68f9", "message": "Tela de Home estruturada\n\nA home vai seguir esse layout estilo tetris, com cada bloco ocupando certas posi\u00e7\u00f5es. Ainda n\u00e3o est\u00e1 com o visual final, ser\u00e1 aplicado posteriormente.", "created_at": "2025-10-30T01:32:48Z", "repo": "GymAPP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "53a5dbb92540153675e7fd1c81fe906e03f3f2cc", "message": "Login e Cadastro com Firebase \n\nO login e cadastro est\u00e3o funcionando, sem a estiliza\u00e7\u00e3o planejada, por\u00e9m ser\u00e1 aplicada posteriormente.\r\nO firebase funciona na vers\u00e3o 8.2.3 e deve ser mantido dessa forma j\u00e1 que \u00e9 a \u00fanica vers\u00e3o que o expo aparenta suportar.", "created_at": "2025-10-30T00:28:20Z", "repo": "GymAPP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4dc783bbdf57b2d3a30aa224809ddb01687878eb", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2025-10-26T22:30:37Z", "repo": "GymAPP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d9efcd40c7cc1554874904d8d192cd6231d8f25f", "message": "About Me", "created_at": "2025-12-27T20:42:12Z", "repo": "BrunoBudan0", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "19447e4a0b8a2b05175b13a41af4d77332ffdab8", "message": "About Me\n\nUpdated personal introduction and tech stack in README.", "created_at": "2025-12-27T20:37:52Z", "repo": "BrunoBudan0", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c9662e867602e241046061637fca61b533cadeac", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2025-12-27T18:43:52Z", "repo": "BrunoBudan0", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}], "prs": []}